BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:LiveMusicAsheville.com
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261114T143000
DTSTAMP:20260929T211302Z
CREATED:20260718T190144Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260929T211302Z
UID:10080229-1794655800-1794666600@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Jazz Brunch w/ “Four Peanuts” trio
DESCRIPTION:Jazz Brunch is now officially on the schedule for every Saturday here in the taproom! We’re so very excited to introduce our newest free weekly event\, open to all ages\, family & pet-friendly\n\n\n\n\n\nIf you haven’t experienced Jazz Brunch yet\, here’s what you can expect: from the moment the music begins\, the taproom fills with that perfect weekend energy… laid-back jazz\, fresh brunch plates\, great beer\, and a room full of people settling in and staying awhile. Friends gather around tables\, conversations flow easily\, and the rhythm of the music sets the tone for a perfect\, easy Saturday. It’s exactly the kind of atmosphere we hoped to create when this idea first came to life!\n\n\n\nWe’re especially excited to continue working with our house Jazz band\, “Four Peanuts”\, whose smooth\, soulful sound brings everything together. The group explores both original compositions and zesty covers of tunes you may or may not know. The trio features Alex Taub on keyboards\, Brennan Dugan on bass\, and Joe Enright on drums\, and will certainly leave your peanuts salted and boiled to perfection! Their music pairs effortlessly with the relaxed brunch setting\, turning an ordinary morning into something memorable. The all-new brunch menu is absolutely something to be excited about! French Broad River Pizza will be serving up a mix of breakfast and lunch favorites designed to pair perfectly with a chill afternoon in the taproom.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThank you for supporting live music\, local artists\, and community gatherings here at French Broad River Brewery. We can’t wait to welcome you back to the taproom… brunch plate in one hand\, beer in the other\, and jazz in the background.\n\n\n  \nFrench Broad River Brewery is more than just a place to enjoy a drink—it’s a community hub where great beer\, delicious pizza\, live music\, and good times come together. Just minutes from the Biltmore Estate & Downtown\, our taproom is a gathering spot for locals and visitors alike. We regularly host live music and entertainment in our taproom\, making French Broad River Brewery a lively hub of local activity. From bluegrass to reggae\, there’s always something happening. Check out our Events Page to see what’s coming up next! \nNo brewery experience is complete without great food. That’s why we offer French Broad River Pizza\, serving up hot\, hand-tossed pizzas made to order. Whether you’re here for a quick slice or a full meal\, our pizza perfectly complements our craft beers and the lively atmosphere of our taproom. frenchbroadbrewery.com/pizza
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jazz-brunch-w-four-peanuts-trio-2-2-2-2/2026-11-14/
LOCATION:French Broad River Brewery\, 101 Fairview Rd\, Asheville\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/IMG_5036-e1777019740232.jpeg
GEO:35.5662722;-82.5374054
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=French Broad River Brewery 101 Fairview Rd Asheville NC United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=101 Fairview Rd:geo:-82.5374054,35.5662722
END:VEVENT
