UID:10106424-1794664800-1794672000@livemusicasheville.com
SUMMARY:Floating Action: Live
DESCRIPTION:One of Asheville’s best-kept musical secrets is coming to The Mule!\n\nFloating Action is the Black Mountain project Seth Kauffman started in 2005\, after his Motown-soaked group The Choosy Beggars called it quits. Seth writes the songs\, writes the lyrics\, plays nearly every instrument\, and records and produces it all himself. The result is homemade psychedelic pop with a lot of heart: warm\, strange\, and crafted by someone who cares more about getting the song right than getting famous.\nThat devotion hasn’t gone unnoticed. Jim James of My Morning Jacket has called him “the most underrated person in music.” Seth has lent his guitar\, bass\, and drums to records by Lana Del Rey\, Angel Olsen\, Ray LaMontagne\, and Jim James\, and the Asheville scene has long considered him one of its own. Floating Action has played South by Southwest and the Hangout Music Festival\, and on November 14 he’s playing our taproom.\n\nThe name says plenty about him: it comes from an out-of-date Gretsch kick-drum pedal. It’s a small\, scrappy piece of gear that became the name of a band worth knowing.\n\nCome early\, grab a seat\, and spend a Saturday afternoon with one of the area’s great underrated songwriters.\n\nFREE. All Ages Welcome.\n  \n\n\n‘The Mule’ – Tasting Room \n\n\n\n\n\nSay hello to The Mule – a full-service bar/event space in the home of Devil’s Foot Beverage’s production facility. Draft soda\, beer\, & wine – as well as delicious cocktails & mocktails featuring Devil’s Foot craft sodas and the largest collection of NC-made spirits in Asheville – all at your fingertips just outside of Biltmore Village! Open now for all of your beverage & party needs! devilsfootbrew.com/the-mule
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/floating-action-live/
LOCATION:The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages\, 131 Sweeten Creek Road\, Asheville\, NC\, 28803\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Screenshot-2026-11-04-050850-e1793787010717.png
GEO:35.5588369;-82.5218977
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Mule at Devils Foot Beverages 131 Sweeten Creek Road Asheville NC 28803 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=131 Sweeten Creek Road:geo:-82.5218977,35.5588369
END:VEVENT
